l_.str.1425:                            ; @.str.1425
	.asciz	"Choose a group of actions with Left or Right.\r\nThen select an action to change its button.\r\nUNBOUND means no button is assigned."

l_.str.1426:                            ; @.str.1426
	.asciz	"Choose buttons for chat and push-to-talk.\r\nChat belongs to the player who opens it.\r\nVoice uses the shared microphone and the\r\nfirst player's team and vehicle channels."

l_.str.1427:                            ; @.str.1427
	.asciz	"These buttons control an available debug camera.\r\nThey do not enable the camera.\r\nThey can reuse your gameplay buttons.\r\nCamera / Player Switch changes who you control."

